<BaseLayout title="About"><article class="prose-page"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>A notebook for better coffee.</h1><p class="lede">Espresso Diaries is a personal record of learning espresso and latte art—one dose, pour, and small adjustment at a time.</p><p>Each entry begins after making a coffee: a few photos, a spoken recollection, and the recipe that produced the cup. The numbers live alongside the human part—the taste, the tiny discoveries, and the patterns that did not quite land.</p><p>This is not a guide to perfect coffee. It is a quiet place to notice progress.</p></article></BaseLayout>
